1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,818
Every night, while the city slept,

2
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:06,920
my father kept watch over a mall that
was not his.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:13,560
He sat by the doors in his old coat,
through the long night shift.

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,297
In the morning he came home tired,

5
00:00:21,297 --> 00:00:24,800
and still he made sure I went to school.

6
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,750
A good school.

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:34,360
A school he could not afford, until he
decided he could.

8
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,200
He never told me what it cost him.

9
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:45,821
Today I work for a good company. I can
help him now.

10
00:00:45,821 --> 00:00:49,660
But I am not where I want to be. Not
yet.

11
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:54,600
Because one day, I will rebuild his
house.

12
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,840
Abba, this is my promise.

13
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,460
{\an5}The Night Keeper
Made with AI, from a true family story
